From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: dts: ingenic: t41: pin the SFC to SPI bus 0

spi_register_controller() gives a controller without a "spi" alias the
first bus number above the highest spiN alias. The T41 tree aliases its
two SSI controllers as spi0 and spi1, so the SFC lands on spi2 and the
U-Boot mtdparts=spi0.0 argument never attaches, leaving only the whole
chip as mtdblock0 and no rootfs.

Alias the SFC as spi0, which is what the mainline 7.x trees expect.
Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/t41.dtsi
+++ b/arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/t41.dtsi
@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@
 		msc0 = &msc0;
 		msc1 = &msc1;
 		mac0 = &mac0;
-		spi0 = &spi0;
+		spi0 = &sfc0;
 		spi1 = &spi1;
 		sfc0 = &sfc0;
 		sfc1 = &sfc1;
